<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reinstates Travelers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill reinstates Travelers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it reinstated Travelers Group Inc with a near-term accumulate and long-term buy rating on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 44-1/2.</p>
</text>
